---
/**
 * The hero's dashboard preview as a small working demo (owner, 2026-11-24).
 *
 * Visitors can switch screens with the top tabs, filter and search the customer list, page
 * through it, open a customer, run the Add-customer wizard with a simulated licence scan,
 * ring up a sale on the POS, switch pawn ranges, filter inventory and take a layaway
 * payment. The footer clock is live (AppFooter's script) and the till total moves when a
 * cash sale completes. Everything is sample data held in the browser; nothing is sent
 * anywhere. Anything the demo doesn't model shows a toast pointing to a real demo.
 *
 * Rendering: the static shell (window, nav, footer, screen frames) is server-rendered so the
 * hero looks right before any script runs; the script then draws the screens' bodies from
 * the JSON below and wires the clicks. Styles are global but every selector is under `.ld`,
 * because rows the script creates don't carry Astro's scoped-style attribute.
 */
